# Claude Code local state — NEVER commit
.claude/

# Per-agent copies of the charter. CLAUDE.md is the one tracked source; a second
# copy (AGENTS.md and friends) drifts the moment a ratified decision is added, and
# one already rode into a commit by accident. Keep yours locally, out of the repo.
AGENTS.md
.codex/

