!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets / local env
.env

# Angular CLI cache
.angular/

# Scratch dir for scripts/check-doc-snippets.mjs (kept only when a snippet fails).
.doc-snippets/

# svelte-package build cache
packages/wrappers/*/.svelte-kit/

# Content stamps for scripts/check-dist-freshness.mjs (mtime is not content).
.dist-freshness/

# Raw vitest JSON report. A build artefact with no reader outside the stamper.
#
# `apps/docs/src/data/test-counts.json` is NOT here, and used to be. The reasoning that
# put it here was "CI runs `test:coverage` before building the docs in the same job, so
# the published figure is measured either way" — and that was measured against the wrong
# build. CI does do exactly that (ci.yml:157 then :184), but THAT docs build is thrown
# away. The site people visit is built by `Dockerfile.docs`, which runs `pnpm install`,
# `pnpm build`, `pnpm --filter docs build` and no tests at all — so the stamp never
# existed in the image, and the landing served its fallback forever. It said "more than
# 1,000 tests" against a real 1,668: a credibility section undersold by 40%, visible to
# every visitor and to nobody developing.
#
# The churn worry that motivated the ignore is already handled in the stamper itself,
# which exits without writing when the numbers have not moved — and it refuses to stamp
# a run that was not fully green, so a tracked number cannot be a failing one. Its own
# docblock says the stamp "IS committed"; the ignore line contradicted it.
#
# Plus TypeDoc scratch.
.vitest-report.json
apps/docs/.typedoc/

# Generated framework bindings — rebuilt from the custom-elements manifest on every
# build, so there is no committed artifact that can fall behind the elements.
packages/*/src/generated/
packages/wrappers/*/src/generated/
# Plugins are one level deeper, and the first two patterns did not reach them — so the
# model-selector's generated bindings were COMMITTED, which is the drifting artifact this
# whole approach exists to avoid.
packages/plugins/*/src/generated/
packages/providers/*/*/src/generated/
packages/locales/*/src/generated/
